<title>CANADA: Canada Nov natural gas sales rise 11.3 percent.</title>
<headline>Canada Nov natural gas sales rise 11.3 percent.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian sales of natural gas rose 11.3 percent in November from the same month a year earlier, to 6,800,114,000 cubic metres, Statistics Canada said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Thousands of cubic meters and percentage changes:</p>
<p>					Nov 96	Nov 95	Pct</p>
<p>Total			     6,800,114    6,109,167  +11.3</p>
<p>Residential sales	     1,889,433    1,688,299  +11.9</p>
<p>Commercial sales		1,355,985    1,211,815  +11.9</p>
<p>Industrial			2,321,409    2,125,230    n/a</p>
<p>Direct sales		    1,233,287    1,083,823    n/a</p>
<p>(For more information from Statistics Canada, contact Gary Smalldridge, Energy Section, at 613-951-3567)</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau 613 235-6745))</p>
</text>
